id: pm-brief-s33p
title: The release job generated the changelog in prepend mode and verified it in replace mode on the next line
description: "release.yml ran npm run changelog, which renders prepend mode with a windowed selection, and then ran changelog:check, which renders replace mode over all release tags. The next release carrying closed but unreleased work would have failed its own verification step."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: changelog,ci,gate,release
created_at: "2026-08-09T20:38:24.568Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-09T20:39:29.915Z"
deadline: "2026-08-10T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-09T20:39:29.893Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-09T20:39:29.893Z"
author: claude
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "The release workflow generates and verifies the changelog with the same renderer mode, and no script renders a mode the gate rejects"
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "The release workflow generates and verifies the changelog in one mode and npm run changelog:check exits 0"
actual_result: "release.yml calls changelog:full before changelog:check, the prepend script is gone, and the changelog check reports up to date"
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-brief-edam,related,"2026-08-09T20:38:42.643Z",claude,"cli:update:dep",asserted
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:38:24.568Z",claude,A fleet sweep comparing only the npm scripts missed this repo because the mismatch was between release.yml and the scripts rather than between two scripts
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:38:24.568Z",claude,"Sixth repository affected by the changelog mode convergence,found after the first five had already been fixed"
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:38:24.568Z",claude,"When auditing for a configuration mismatch,compare what actually runs rather than the scripts alone,because a workflow calling a script directly is a second call site the script-to-script comparison never sees"
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  package.json,project,prepend changelog script removed
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  "npm run changelog:check",project,120
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project,release step that generated and verified in different modes
close_reason: "Release now generates with changelog:full so it verifies the same rendering, and the prepend script that no gate accepts is removed"
body: "The gate passes today only because no closed-but-unreleased item exists, so both modes happen to render the same file. That is luck, not correctness: replace mode emits an Unreleased section for closed but unreleased work and prepend mode with --until-release-tag structurally cannot, so the first release following such an item would generate a file and reject it one line later. Found while resolving a reviewer finding on pm-csv about the prepend script surviving the convergence, which is what pointed at pm-brief still calling it from the release path."
